---
description: Non-negotiables for the legal-agents repo
alwaysApply: true
---
Read AGENTS.md first; it is the single source of truth.

- Public or synthetic documents only. Never a client document or a real matter.
- Agents flag, they never clear. No output is final, cleared, approved, compliant or safe_to_file.
- No model, provider or vendor names anywhere under agents/. Models are chosen at runtime (--provider/--model).
- No secrets in files. Environment variables only.
- Confidential or privileged text only goes to endpoints with verified zero data retention (registry zdr: true + verified_on).
- Never edit golden.jsonl or thresholds.yaml to make a run pass. Never let a model pre-fill labels.
- Do not run live evals or paid model calls unless asked. `la eval --replay` is free.

Before finishing any change: `uv run la validate --all` and `uv run pytest`.
